<GuideLayout 
  title="Custom Branding: From Silicone Patches to 3D Logos"
  description="Elevate your activewear brand with high-end customization techniques that create a premium, luxury consumer experience."
  publishDate="June 26, 2026"
>
  <p>In the world of premium activewear, the difference between a basic garment and a luxury brand is in the branding execution. At Fitclo, we provide specialized B2B customization services that go far beyond simple screen printing.</p>

  <h2>1. 3D Silicone Transfer Patches</h2>
  <p>The standard for high-end gym wear. These patches provide a tactile, premium feel that doesn't crack or peel. They offer a depth and texture that instantly signals 'luxury' to the consumer.</p>

  <h2>2. Reflective & Iridescent Heat Transfers</h2>
  <p>Perfect for safety in running gear and a futuristic aesthetic in studio wear. We use industrial-grade heat presses to ensure these logos stay bonded through hundreds of wash cycles, maintaining the garment's performance and look.</p>

  <h2>3. Custom Woven Labels & Eco-Packaging</h2>
  <p>True branding is a holistic experience. We offer customized inner neck tapes, branded woven labels, and 100% compostable shipping bags to ensure every touchpoint reflects your brand’s commitment to quality and sustainability.</p>

</GuideLayout>
